---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - TypeWhisper"
  description="TypeWhisper privacy policy. All data stays on your device - no collection, no tracking."
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:py-16">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Last updated: February 2026</p>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Overview</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">TypeWhisper is a local-first desktop app for macOS and Windows. We are committed to your privacy and designed TypeWhisper to process all data entirely on your device.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Data Collection</h2>
        <p class="mt-2"><strong>TypeWhisper does not collect any data.</strong> All audio processing, transcription, and storage happens locally on your device. No audio, transcription text, or usage data is ever sent to any server.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Local Storage</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">TypeWhisper stores the following data locally in your OS-specific app data directory (for example Application Support on macOS or AppData on Windows):</p>
        <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 list-disc pl-5">
          <li>Transcription history (text, timestamps, app context)</li>
          <li>User profiles and settings</li>
          <li>Downloaded AI models</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-2">This data is stored only on your device and is not accessible to us or any third party.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Network Access</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">TypeWhisper connects to the internet only to download AI models from Hugging Face. After models are downloaded, the app can function entirely offline.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">TypeWhisper does not integrate with any analytics, advertising, or tracking services.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Open Source</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">TypeWhisper is open source under the GPLv3 license. You can audit the entire source code on <a href="https://github.com/TypeWhisper" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">GitHub</a>.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">If you have questions about this privacy policy, please open an issue on our <a href="https://github.com/TypeWhisper" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">GitHub organization</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
